Rust crates and the forks
-------------------------

Third-party crates keep their own upstream licences; nothing is vendored.

`rust/` is a submodule of a fork of the Rust compiler and standard library, and
carries upstream's own licensing. Its `src/llvm-project` is ToyOSOrg's fork of
rust-lang/llvm-project, Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception like upstream's; the
toolchain release carries the clang, `lld` and LLVM tools built from it.


